{"4547520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Harbinger of the Deep", "steam_appid": 4547520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4547520/extras/ab2c9dba9679211e387689bac2570223.avif?t=1787980583\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slice, Shock, or Shout away other Beings' frustrations!</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully choose your actions to destroy others' frustrations and befriend them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or, ignore them and choose to slay them all</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the bullet hell of other Beings' frustrations and keep yourself alive</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4547520/extras/1b887eb8feb64a534a67018a894f851f.poster.avif?t=1787980583\" width=616 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4547520/extras/1b887eb8feb64a534a67018a894f851f.webm?t=1787980583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4547520/extras/1b887eb8feb64a534a67018a894f851f.mp4?t=1787980583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4547520/extras/4e08055061e6b65160953aede2268f3b.avif?t=1787980583\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey through 8 vast areas of the Sea!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out the secrets that caused the Tsunami</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harder and harder challenges await the further areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock many shortcuts to travel the Sea easier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet many different faces and Beings along your journey</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4547520/extras/91d71a483ca9f6d6a78474113566d7c4.avif?t=1787980583\" width=616 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4547520/extras/393c747aa6425c6df33c0716822941c1.avif?t=1787980583\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your path and define the future of the Sea!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the fate of the Beings you meet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead them or leave them all behind</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4547520/extras/39e2b044e145ed673ea39f93c303d45c.poster.avif?t=1787980583\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4547520/extras/39e2b044e145ed673ea39f93c303d45c.webm?t=1787980583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4547520/extras/39e2b044e145ed673ea39f93c303d45c.mp4?t=1787980583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4547520/extras/b481a199a427ed22f9742536f0d316f9.av